<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Lend Lease has Seven stake.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Lend Lease has Seven stake.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lend Lease Corp Ltd, which has property, insurance, and funds management interests, said on Tuesday that it held a 5.03 percent stake in television network Seven Network Ltd, the half owner of Hollywood's MGM studios.</p>
<p>The company said in a substantial notice to the Australian Stock Exchange that it owned 14.683 million Seven shares.</p>
<p>The exchange requires companies to reveal their holdings once they exceed five percent. Seven chairman Kerry Stokes is the largest shareholder with a 24.085 percent stake while Rupert Murdoch's News Corp Ltd has 15 percent.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 561-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
